License: other
 The files under contrib/certificates/ are public X.509 trust anchors used for
 I2P reseed and family verification. They are redistributed verbatim by the
 issuing projects and contain no executable code. This package does not claim
 a copyright interest in the certificate material; see each certificate and
 the corresponding upstream project for provenance and terms.
